    "name": "Steel Runner - VR Block Craft Sandbox",
    "steam_appid": 2855870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Runner is a VR vehicle crafting sandbox game using physics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique Runner(vehicle) by combining various types of blocks, then ride it to enjoy free exploration, adventure, and combat in an open-world environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vast open-world, you will spawn with a small runner that you are initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your runner to chop down trees, gather ores, and fight enemies to collect blocks, modifying and upgrading it to aim for the ultimate runner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, you may want to switch to a different runner, or your runner might get destroyed by enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry, as long as you have the materials, you can always summon your runner from the saved blueprint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create various amazing runners and make this vast open-world your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/9c7f356f848adb427c4ee9ff34afb60d.avif?t=1752551633\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design and Construction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runners can be created by combining 1 x 1 m blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a vehicle body, attach tyres and... you're ready to move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also numerous modules such as weapons, shields and batteries, so get creative with the placement to create your one and only runner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each combined block has its own HP, and blocks that can no longer be connected to the centre of the runner will drop out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your weak points hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open-world built with multiple biomes, various terrains with differing elevations, and numerous points of interest (POIs)! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the design of your runner, you may find some terrains easier to drive than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/02d7496edbe8af1423596852b35377ce.avif?t=1752551633\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players piloting their runners can use the controller to aim the weapons attached to their runner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons such as cannons, lasers, missiles, and anti-aircraft guns to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancing your runner's defense with armor and shields, or modifying the runner structure to create a more resistable design, is also crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/71f56beeecdc3b6263b3b91725cab9fa.avif?t=1752551633\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by \u201cCRIWARE\u201d.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Runner is a VR vehicle crafting sandbox game using physics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique Runner(vehicle) by combining various types of blocks, then ride it to enjoy free exploration, adventure, and combat in an open-world environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vast open-world, you will spawn with a small runner that you are initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your runner to chop down trees, gather ores, and fight enemies to collect blocks, modifying and upgrading it to aim for the ultimate runner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, you may want to switch to a different runner, or your runner might get destroyed by enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry, as long as you have the materials, you can always summon your runner from the saved blueprint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create various amazing runners and make this vast open-world your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/9c7f356f848adb427c4ee9ff34afb60d.avif?t=1752551633\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design and Construction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runners can be created by combining 1 x 1 m blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a vehicle body, attach tyres and... you're ready to move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also numerous modules such as weapons, shields and batteries, so get creative with the placement to create your one and only runner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each combined block has its own HP, and blocks that can no longer be connected to the centre of the runner will drop out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your weak points hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open-world built with multiple biomes, various terrains with differing elevations, and numerous points of interest (POIs)! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the design of your runner, you may find some terrains easier to drive than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/02d7496edbe8af1423596852b35377ce.avif?t=1752551633\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players piloting their runners can use the controller to aim the weapons attached to their runner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons such as cannons, lasers, missiles, and anti-aircraft guns to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancing your runner's defense with armor and shields, or modifying the runner structure to create a more resistable design, is also crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/71f56beeecdc3b6263b3b91725cab9fa.avif?t=1752551633\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by \u201cCRIWARE\u201d.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Steel Runner is a VR vehicle crafting sandbox game using physics. Create your own unique vehicle by combining various types of blocks, then ride it to enjoy free exploration, adventure, and combat in an open-world environment. Shape your ideal vehicle and explore this vast world!",
